=== Todo 8 — auditoria do CI existente ===
Arquivo: .github/workflows/ci.yml
name: CI

on:
  push:
    branches: [master]
  pull_request:
    branches: [master]

jobs:
  lint-test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    strategy:
      matrix:
        python-version: ["3.11", "3.12"]

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Install uv
        uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@v3

      - name: Set up Python ${{ matrix.python-version }}
        run: uv python install ${{ matrix.python-version }}

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: |
          uv pip install --system pytest pytest-cov ruff mypy

      - name: Lint with ruff
        run: ruff check . --ignore E501,F403,F401,E402

      - name: Type check with mypy
        run: mypy . --ignore-missing-imports --exclude tests/ || true

      - name: Test with pytest
        run: pytest tests/ --cov=. --cov-report=term-missing --cov-report=xml -v

      - name: Upload coverage
        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v4
        with:
          file: ./coverage.xml
          fail_ci_if_error: false

=== Veredicto ===
1. Suíte pytest completa roda no CI: SIM (step 'Test with pytest': pytest tests/ --cov=.)
2. Ruff já cobre tudo inclusive scripts/ e tests/: SIM (ruff check . --ignore E501,F403,F401,E402)
3. mypy non-blocking (|| true): escolha pré-existente mantida (fora do escopo endurecer)
4. Ação requerida: NENHUMA no workflow — pyproject.toml local (todo 9) deve espelhar os ignores do CI (E501,F403,F401,E402)
